+All dates in this project are written as ISO YYYY-MM-DD, in the ledgers and in
+project prose alike. The alternative was leaving date format to each writer,
+which produces ambiguous forms like 09/08/2026 that read differently by region
+and cannot be sorted or diffed reliably.
